    crm:P183i_has_representation <https://ids.lib.harvard.edu/ids/iiif/493312856/full/full/0/default.jpg> ;
    rdf:value """Monday, Dec. 25, 1905
London. Fine.
I got to Church — a Palestrina Mass, very beautiful. Florence: Bernhard at Labouchère’s.
Tuesday, Dec. 26, 1905 Karin better. Nowers called.
Bernhard at Labouchère’s talked with the Princess Kudacheff, Trepov’s niece.
Wednesday, Dec. 27, 1905
Roger came to lunch and said he would try to get Glaenzer to buy the Lotto. He took Ray and me to see the Velasquez Venus.
Bernhard lunched with Placcis and took Mrs. Sears to Bardini’s. Labouchère’s Christmas tree."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 142 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1905> .

